          "id": "player_bored_001_01",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "退屈なんだ。じゃあ、脳が机を叩き始める前に何か置こう。",
          "displayText": "You are bored. Then let us put something down before your brain starts tapping on the desk.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "player_bored_001_02",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "playful",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "player_bored_001_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "小さいタスク、変な質問、短い散歩。どれか一つだけでも空気は変わるよ。",
          "displayText": "A tiny task, a strange question, or a short walk. Even one of those can change the air.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "warm",
            "animation": ""
